   Begin Object Name="MaterialExpressionComment_21" ExportPath="/Script/Engine.MaterialExpressionComment'/Game/FluidNinjaLive/OutputMaterials/Base/MF_NinjaOutput_BaseFunction_VOLUME.MF_NinjaOutput_BaseFunction_VOLUME:MaterialExpressionComment_21'"
      SizeX=304
      SizeY=336
      Text="4"
      CommentColor=(R=1.000000,G=0.546405,B=0.000000,A=1.000000)
      FontSize=200
      MaterialExpressionEditorX=-11760
      MaterialExpressionEditorY=-1040
      MaterialExpressionGuid=33E2A3774FA5A0D32683019339F7B49D
      Function="/Script/Engine.MaterialFunction'MF_NinjaOutput_BaseFunction_VOLUME'"
   End Object
   Begin Object Name="MaterialExpressionComment_22" ExportPath="/Script/Engine.MaterialExpressionComment'/Game/FluidNinjaLive/OutputMaterials/Base/MF_NinjaOutput_BaseFunction_VOLUME.MF_NinjaOutput_BaseFunction_VOLUME:MaterialExpressionComment_22'"
      SizeX=2976
      SizeY=320
      Text="1. This material is a compositor: generates a 3D volume by combining extruded 2D fluidsim + 3D noise\r\n2. To calculate correct Ambient Occlusion (AO)...\r\n   (A) we\'d need to WRITE-OUT and RE-SAMPLE the volume generated by this compositor material...\r\n   (B) ...and use the sampled data to perform a simple neighbor-compare or volumetric raymarching\r\n3. To avoid volume read-write the management and the processing-burden of raymarching, we are using FAKE AO\r\n\r\nThe fake AO method:\r\nWe multiply volume-density with inverted vol.density... resulting \"dark\" values in zero AND high-density areas (typically around-the-volume and DEEP volume),\r\nand \"bright\" values in low-density areas (typically SURFACE volume. We are using the above generated \"surface brightness\" to drive emissive."
      CommentColor=(R=0.000000,G=0.224817,B=0.276042,A=1.000000)
      FontSize=12
      MaterialExpressionEditorX=-4768
      MaterialExpressionEditorY=-1056
      MaterialExpressionGuid=606A3BD2489C71FBBC7E28BF49F3685E
      Function="/Script/Engine.MaterialFunction'MF_NinjaOutput_BaseFunction_VOLUME'"
   End Object
   Begin Object Name="MaterialExpressionComment_23" ExportPath="/Script/Engine.MaterialExpressionComment'/Game/FluidNinjaLive/OutputMaterials/Base/MF_NinjaOutput_BaseFunction_VOLUME.MF_NinjaOutput_BaseFunction_VOLUME:MaterialExpressionComment_23'"
      SizeX=368
      SizeY=288
      Text="IF Density XYZ is WorldSpace,\r\nOffer Z-axis lock"
      CommentColor=(R=0.041667,G=0.041667,B=0.041667,A=1.000000)
      FontSize=12
      MaterialExpressionEditorX=-12416
      MaterialExpressionEditorY=992
      MaterialExpressionGuid=63F9F01C4B5A9703FB5164994C8C304D
