      Text="HeightUpScale param: We need to scale down LARGE (n > 32000) Landscape Height values before RT WRITE, and scale them back following RT READ, otherwise values get clamped.\r\nSome weird UE behaviour, clamping in the data pipeline. (using 32 bit RenderTargets did NOT help)"
