      Function="/Script/Engine.MaterialFunction'MF_NinjaOutput_BaseFunction_VOLUME'"
      Desc="If TRUE, the volume material is using WORLD XY Coordinates,\r\ninstead of the LOCAL Coordinates of the volume container.\r\nAs a consequence: noise pattern is getting \"anchored\" to the level,\r\nthe volume container could \"leave behind\" the pattern - as opposed to local\r\ncoords, where the pattern \"sticks to the volume\", moves together with the volume."
   End Object
