      Desc="In order to construct a proper 3D velocity volume, we need to apply\r\na \"gradient function\" to the grayscale 2D density input - to figure out its \"slope direction\".\r\nThis is performance heavy - so alternatively, we could set THIS param to FALSE,\r\nand provide the material with a separate \"velocity input\" (precalculated gradient)"
   End Object
