      Desc="By default, velocity is used in the (-1)-to-(+1) range, ZERO is \"no velocity\".\r\nNORMALIZED velocity uses the 0-to-1 range, 0.5 is \"no velocity\".\r\nOn-disk texture assets are usually 0-1 --- while the real-time generated\r\nsimulation velocity input coming from ninja is in the (-1)-to-(+1) range."
   End Object
